{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>The prison's security has been breached and all the cell doors have opened.  You and your fellow Jailiens need to find a way out before backup arrives!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destructible Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/c7ac02e7e0d441eb359686a2b189c845.poster.avif?t=1756499121\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/c7ac02e7e0d441eb359686a2b189c845.webm?t=1756499121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/c7ac02e7e0d441eb359686a2b189c845.mp4?t=1756499121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Break through doors, vents, and weak walls using explosives and other tools, to reach restricted areas.  Dig an underground tunnel using your trusty spoon, for a stealthy escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi-Layered Interactivity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/5939e76b66a532c0c69e2789d50b3100.poster.avif?t=1756499121\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/5939e76b66a532c0c69e2789d50b3100.webm?t=1756499121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/5939e76b66a532c0c69e2789d50b3100.mp4?t=1756499121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Environment is everything. Check the cameras to locate guards, or hijack the intercom to communicate with teammates across the prison. Destroy the generators to cut the building's power, disabling anti-aircraft guns and phone lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Proximity Chat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/d7e28b23ffd414c0b6018b6256b88dcc.poster.avif?t=1756499121\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/d7e28b23ffd414c0b6018b6256b88dcc.webm?t=1756499121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/d7e28b23ffd414c0b6018b6256b88dcc.mp4?t=1756499121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Ultra realistic proximity chat using dynamic reverb, occlusion, and directional audio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick Your Playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/0e2a99f5ec4de385ea52a6c7b7cde318.poster.avif?t=1756499121\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/0e2a99f5ec4de385ea52a6c7b7cde318.webm?t=1756499121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/0e2a99f5ec4de385ea52a6c7b7cde318.mp4?t=1756499121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>10 player lobbies, enable many play styles.  Team up with a few friends and work together to be the first prisoners out, betray your team and escape alone, or gang up on other teams to hinder their progress.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Massive Roster of Tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/525fd45cafba5f0921a2158ac95bb979.poster.avif?t=1756499121\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/525fd45cafba5f0921a2158ac95bb979.webm?t=1756499121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/525fd45cafba5f0921a2158ac95bb979.mp4?t=1756499121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use a pan to beat up a guard.  Use the panic button that the guard dropped to attract guards away from a restricted area.  Access the restricted area and find a ray gun. Epic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tons of Unique Escape Routes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/5a44717393f55c8b3c9e112addaf9ef5.poster.avif?t=1756499121\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/5a44717393f55c8b3c9e112addaf9ef5.webm?t=1756499121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/5a44717393f55c8b3c9e112addaf9ef5.mp4?t=1756499121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>There are many intermingled routes, tools and mechanics that allow for many  escape plans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gerjohntons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/5d53f7f18a998fc62246686554c3d832.poster.avif?t=1756499121\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/5d53f7f18a998fc62246686554c3d832.webm?t=1756499121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/5d53f7f18a998fc62246686554c3d832.mp4?t=1756499121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>They don\u2019t like you very much.  Kill them I guess.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2592220?t=1756499121","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756499121","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756499121","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756499121","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Criminals breaking out of prison, drug use, unclothed aliens (blurred), beating up aliens and prison guards."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>The prison's security has been breached and all the cell doors have opened.  You and y